@startuml
title Product Catalog Management - Step 7 - Product Offering marketing launch

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<blackbox>> Black
  ParticipantFontColor<<blackbox>> White
}

actor Marketer
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM #purple
participant "ProductCatalogManagement" as PCM <<blackbox>>
participant "LocationManagement" as LM #blue
participant "EventManager" as EventMgr #grey

Marketer -> EM : 140 marketer is connecting to catalog app
EM -> PCM : 141 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(WelcomeCatalog, marketer)
activate PCM
PCM --> EM : 142 **TMF701** 201 Created\n(List of available actions: CreateProductOffering,\nManageProductOffering, RetrieveNotification,\nCreatePOP, ManagePOP, Test PO, Launch PO)

Marketer -> EM : 143 I will launch the offer on few shops
EM -> LM : 144 **TMF674 Geographic Site Management**\nGET /geographicSite/?@type=shop&place.city=Lyon&place.@type=GeographicAddress
LM --> EM : 145 **TMF674** 200 OK\n(GeographicSite 45, 8, 96 representations)

group Launch Product offering

    Marketer -> EM : 146 Launch ProductOffering #569 for few shops
    EM -> PCM : 147 **TMF Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(ManageProductOffering, PO#569,\nstate launched, channel=shop, place=[45,8,96])

    PCM -> PCM : 148 Check state change consistency for PO/PS/POP

    PCM -> PCM : 149 **TMF620 Product Catalog Management**\nPATCH /productOffering.id569\n(state launched, channel, place)

    PCM --> EM : 150 **TMF620** 200 OK\n(ProductOffering #569 shifts to launched)

    PCM -> EventMgr : 151 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST /productOfferingStateChangeEvent\n(PO #569, state = launched)

end
deactivate PCM

@enduml
